Frictional-Fibers — Authors
===========================

Discrete element method (DEM) simulation of elastic rods (fibers) in
frictional contact, on GPU (OpenCL).

Author and developer
--------------------
Jérôme Crassous <jerome.crassous@univ-rennes1.fr>
  Web:   https://jerome-crassous.github.io/
  ORCID: 0000-0002-0877-5906
